{"unit_id":"syncended__deepseek-harness-split-screen#card-zh","repo":"syncended/deepseek-harness-split-screen","commit":"83f394ba1a5837cd60de203821981f389193c254","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Split Screen 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的会话分屏插件：它把多个会话放进主对话区域的可调整窗格中。用户可以横向或纵向拆分布局、在窗格内切换会话标签、拖动分隔线调整比例，也能查看实时对话、加载较早记录并发送或停止文本消息。每个窗格还可选择模型和访问模式，并查看上下文与 token 统计。适合需要同时跟进多个 DSH 会话的网页用户；需在 Web profile 中安装，无需额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1337","lib/client.js:1366","lib/client.js:1717"]}
{"unit_id":"syncended__deepseek-harness-split-screen#card-en","repo":"syncended/deepseek-harness-split-screen","commit":"83f394ba1a5837cd60de203821981f389193c254","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@syncended/dsh-split-screen adds resizable panes to DSH Web for multiple sessions. Split the layout, switch tabs, read live or older messages, and send text or stop a turn. Panes also offer model and access controls plus context and token stats. Install in a Web profile; no extra key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1337","lib/client.js:1366","lib/client.js:1717"]}
