{"unit_id":"syncended__deepseek-harness-split-screen#caveat-1","repo":"syncended/deepseek-harness-split-screen","commit":"83f394ba1a5837cd60de203821981f389193c254","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@syncended/dsh-split-screen 使用前须知：布局、窗格选择状态和未发送草稿保存在当前浏览器 origin 的 localStorage；清除站点存储会移除这些本地状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:498","lib/client.js:554"]}
